  "desc": "白石與星銀鑄成的長槍，鋒銳的尖刃上總是縈纏著刺骨的寒意。",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/05/15/173531aa00de724260fb5c8ce21ce625_742789739843295350.png",
